{{!
    @template block_dimensions/filter_line

    The filter line of one section of the block, plans or competencies
    (moodle-dev/docs/filter-line/CONTRACT.md): the line, in the contract's slot order, and the
    row of chips under it. summary.mustache draws one per section, under its heading.

    The server draws the frame and its words; amd/src/filters.js fills what depends on the
    dataset and amd/src/filter_line.js folds the line and drives its search:
    * the scope (plans only): the status pills, a radio group filters.js renders into
      dims-line-scope, hidden while fewer than two buckets are a choice;
    * the search: a pill field with its magnifier and its eraser, which is never a cross; the
      search's icon (dims-search-open) stands for the field once the line folds it away, and the
      close button (dims-search-close), the line's last control, closes the search grown over the
      line. Neither is drawn until the module has folded the line into a step;
    * the favourites star, aria-pressed, hidden while the section has no favourite to show;
    * Filters, which opens the panel (aria-expanded, aria-controls) and carries a count badge of
      the tag filters in force; filters.js renders the section's tag groups into the panel's
      dims-filters-host, and the panel's foot is "Clear filters" and "Show N";
    * the listbox of suggestions, given its role by the module, which carries its three headings
      so the module composes no word of them.

    Every control the search slides out of the way when it grows over the line carries
    dims-line-slides. The whole toolbar is hidden until the section has something to show.

    Context variables required:
    * id (string) - Prefix of every id the line writes
    * type (string) - The section: plan or competency
    * hasscope (bool) - Whether the section has a scope (the plans' status buckets)
    * hassearch (bool) - Whether the search is on (enable_search)
    * searchlabel, searchplaceholder (string) - The field's name and placeholder
    * itemslabel (string) - Heading of the matching cards in the suggestions
    * panellabel (string) - Accessible name of the Filters panel

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "block-dimensions-1-plan",
        "type": "plan",
        "hasscope": true,
        "hassearch": true,
        "searchlabel": "Search plans",
        "searchplaceholder": "Search plans…",
        "itemslabel": "Learning plans",
        "panellabel": "Filter learning plans"
    }
}}
<div class="dims-line-toolbar" data-region="dims-line-toolbar" data-line-type="{{type}}" hidden>
    <div class="dims-line" data-region="dims-line">
        {{#hasscope}}
        <div class="dims-line-scope" data-region="dims-line-scope" hidden></div>
        {{/hasscope}}
        {{#hassearch}}
        <div class="dims-line-search" data-region="dims-line-search">
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="{{id}}-search">{{searchlabel}}</label>
            <i class="fa fa-search dims-line-searchicon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <input type="search" id="{{id}}-search" class="dims-line-input" data-search-type="{{type}}" placeholder="{{searchplaceholder}}" autocomplete="off">
            <button type="button" class="dims-line-eraser" data-action="dims-search-clear" aria-label="{{#str}}line_clear_text, block_dimensions{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}line_clear_text, block_dimensions{{/str}}" hidden><i class="fa fa-eraser" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="dims-line-iconbtn dims-line-searchopen dims-line-slides" data-action="dims-search-open" aria-controls="{{id}}-search" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="{{searchlabel}}" title="{{searchlabel}}"><i class="fa fa-search" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        {{/hassearch}}
        <button type="button" class="dims-line-iconbtn dims-line-star dims-line-slides" data-region="dims-line-star" data-fav-star="{{type}}" aria-pressed="false" title="{{#str}}line_favourites, block_dimensions{{/str}}" hidden><i class="fa fa-star-o" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}line_favourites, block_dimensions{{/str}} <span data-fav-count></span></span></button>
        <div class="dims-line-filters dims-line-slides" data-region="dims-line-filters" hidden>
            <button type="button" class="dims-line-filterstoggle" data-action="dims-filters-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{id}}-panel"><i class="fa fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="dims-line-label">{{#str}}line_filters, block_dimensions{{/str}}</span> <span class="dims-line-badge" data-region="dims-line-badge" hidden></span></button>
            <div class="dims-line-panel" id="{{id}}-panel" data-region="dims-line-panel" role="group" aria-label="{{panellabel}}" hidden>
                <div class="dims-filters-host" data-filters-type="{{type}}"></div>
                <div class="dims-line-panelfoot">
                    <button type="button" class="dims-clear-filters-btn" data-clear-type="{{type}}" style="display:none"><i class="fa fa-eraser" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{#str}}clearfilters, block_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
                    <button type="button" class="dims-line-show" data-action="dims-panel-show">{{#str}}line_show, block_dimensions{{/str}} <span data-region="dims-panel-count">0</span></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{#hassearch}}
        <button type="button" class="dims-line-iconbtn dims-line-searchclose" data-action="dims-search-close" aria-label="{{#str}}line_close_search, block_dimensions{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}line_close_search, block_dimensions{{/str}}"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        <div class="dims-line-suggest" id="{{id}}-suggest" data-region="dims-line-suggest" data-label-filters="{{#str}}line_suggest_filters, block_dimensions{{/str}}" data-label-start="{{#str}}line_suggest_start, block_dimensions{{/str}}" data-label-items="{{itemslabel}}" hidden></div>
        {{/hassearch}}
    </div>
    <div class="dims-line-chips" data-region="dims-line-chips" data-label-remove="{{#str}}line_remove_filter, block_dimensions{{/str}}" hidden>
        <div class="dims-line-chiplist" data-region="dims-line-chiplist"></div>
        <button type="button" class="dims-line-clearall" data-action="dims-clear-all" hidden>{{#str}}line_clear_all, block_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
</div>
